WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.083
Step 1: After inviting a user, open Roster details in User setup. For an existing employee, open Users → pencil → Pay Conditions.

2
00:00:08.083 --> 00:00:17.708
Step 2: Open Allowances and tick the applicable choices. Uniform laundry applies automatically; cold work, vehicle use, extra travel, overtime meals and expense reimbursements depend on actual work.

3
00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:26.083
Step 3: Check the Pay Rates preview and press Save employment details. Selections use the employment effective date and remain available when editing later.

4
00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:36.958
Step 4: Build the roster using the saved staff settings. Confirm variable quantities and meal conditions in Timesheets → Pay details → Actual allowance details and reimbursements, with a reason, before approval.
